{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>in peace</b> — without fear." "And the meaning of יחדו — the plural, and He is with them." "And thus the word לבטח — with a lamed, or in its absence it is equivalent." "And thus the word לבדד — and there is בדד, and behold, YHWH alone leads him. And it is correct that HaShem alone, and thus this is either its meaning, or: they were together with me, or: I was לבדד, and the meaning: alone You settle me."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:12.178331290Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}